A responsive class shows a hidden element on some screens, so it is kept.
-- input.html --
<body><div class="hidden xl:block"><p>Shown</p></div></body>
-- want.html --
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title>
<link rel="canonical" href="http://example.com/"/></head>
<body data-id="0"><div class="hidden" data-id="1"><p data-id="2">Shown</p></div></body></html>
